  "repo_truth": "Five prior fresh reviews returned findings over earlier immutable subjects. The parent recorded remediations and now submits a 26-path subject that includes all five prior dispatches and all five remediation records. This dispatch states no conclusion about whether those findings are closed or whether the current subject is implementation-grade.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Remain read-only and replay all 26 manifest hashes, Python-ordinal order, aggregate, dispatch schema, HCM-2.2 handoff, and review ancestry before review.",
    "Review the complete documentation subject and all coupled status corrections, not merely prior findings.",
    "Independently validate all three Draft 2020-12 schemas, six duplicate-safe JSON artifacts, normalized selection equivalence, all runtime/control positives, semantic uniqueness/cross-record rules, links, fingerprints, and cross-document consistency.",
    "Return evidence-backed findings ordered Critical, Required, Optional, Nit with exact evidence, failure mode, smallest authority-preserving repair, and missing validation."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, staging, commits, handoff/ledger writes, branch changes, preservation access, or user task hops.",
    "No Rust, Cargo, runtime tests, production assets, CLI/SDK implementation, HCM-2.2 reinterpretation, HCM-2.4, Phase 3+, or Phase 4 implementation.",
    "Do not accept remediation prose as a success conclusion; test every disposition independently."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Invoke required skills, read AGENTS.md, and return BLOCKED on manifest or authority mismatch.",
    "Verify all five prior review/remediation rounds independently, including selection normalization, persisted bytes, operation mappings, Phase 4 boundary, installed_complete recovery, timestamp identity, definition ordering, and cross-suite context currentness.",
    "Verify operation-context resolved_definitions exactly equal their UTF-8 definition_ref-sorted projection and the derived context fingerprint is identical across coverage, all four runtime records, and all three transaction intents.",
    "Replay the complete regenerated intake-to-validation-to-candidate-to-promotion identity/ref/persisted-byte chain and every request, transaction, intent, staging, installed-complete, marker, evidence, result, and ledger dependency.",
    "Verify all positive/negative schema and semantic oracles, recovery/replay/currentness/retention rules, source/path/ref safety, classification ceiling, Phase 4 boundary, HCM-2.2 compatibility, and implementation-grade completeness without invented authority.",
    "Verify final-review/primary-commit inventory includes every prior dispatch/remediation artifact and excludes only the active dispatch.",
    "Return CLEAN only with zero Critical, Required, Optional, and Nit findings; otherwise CHANGES_REQUIRED or BLOCKED without repair."
  ],
