    "Return BLOCKED on any subject-fingerprint, source-handoff, review-chain, or authority mismatch.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if implementation must invent an identity, schema field/value, source closure, authority edge, operation order, persisted bytes, verified basis, timestamp, write/result/evidence mapping, idempotency/replay rule, recovery state, test oracle, or Phase 4 boundary.",
